{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1672.unity3d","item_key":"commands[4].text","source_sha256":"916bfff03c0b53d0d03d9cb29a99d018884f88d2802a3faeb9ee8de40b32faaf","ja":"作戦準備","zh":"作战准备","status":"accepted","updated_at":"2026-10-13T06:48:17+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1672.unity3d","item_key":"commands[5].text","source_sha256":"ebb13cb02eb9a42a74c94a151973ce630f5193f7b59edbe8655aebdd71887899","ja":"ねえねえ、今度の日曜、アクセが買えるイベントが\nあるんだけど、みんなで一緒に行かない？","zh":"我说我说，这周日有个可以买饰品的活动，\n要不要大家一起去呀？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1672.unity3d","item_key":"commands[6].text","source_sha256":"e2b858ffd176fba0eecb89b63f5196111576065a9bf92fc26855c4ee86b1a1f0","ja":"うん、ぜひ！　私もファッションの流行を、\n勉強しておきたいし。","zh":"嗯，一定要去！我也想顺便\n学习一下流行时尚。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1672.unity3d","item_key":"commands[7].text","source_sha256":"5c95cd88c9bf93e09724fe97d44746f003dea4cff2177b3e3887c915adf64f05","ja":"茜ちゃんも行く行く～！\nそのイベントって、どこでやるの？","zh":"小茜也要去要去～！\n那个活动是在哪里举办的呀？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1672.unity3d","item_key":"commands[8].text","source_sha256":"26c1d2833180823778b356b7a6a0e528510dfebf1eede922920eeee3a849613a","ja":"えーっとね……はい、これ。\nイベントのホームページだよ。","zh":"我想想哦……给你，这个。\n是活动的网页哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1672.unity3d","item_key":"commands[9].text","source_sha256":"6bf6344646158f284e5165f1cb641a031071aab54f8425dd306bb687a06a946f","ja":"大きな会場でいろんなお店が出る、\nけっこう有名なやつなんだ。","zh":"是在大场地里有各种摊位出展，\n相当出名的一个活动。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1672.unity3d","item_key":"commands[10].text","source_sha256":"ea5bc6f1f59ba53552081492be6ab0eaf88a4995f833e19fd5b08749623fceb9","ja":"たくさんお店が並んでるんだね。\n有名なんだったら人も多いだろうし、これなら……。","zh":"开着好多家店呢。\n要是很有名的话人应该也挺多，这样一来……。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1672.unity3d","item_key":"commands[11].text","source_sha256":"1c1f2be22daaaa99c03fa1c146234f92d4bfc27133ed1adf1368007daf879a40","ja":"ねぇねぇ、変装して行かない？\n名付けて、『誰にもバレずにお買い物しよう大作戦』！","zh":"我说我说，要不要乔装打扮一下再去？\n代号就叫，“瞒过所有人去买东西大作战”！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1672.unity3d","item_key":"commands[12].text","source_sha256":"18d3dc7f01329b683dfb03f8f465ca73839576b675282f80e35d0f04c3bb9fc8","ja":"「実は茜ちゃんたちも会場にいたの」ってSNSで\nネタばらししたら、バズること間違いなしだよ！","zh":"要是发SNS揭秘说\n“其实小茜她们也在现场”，肯定会大火的！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1672.unity3d","item_key":"commands[13].text","source_sha256":"5213e6687340ee6a9780845bb1c996e406faaba9768722deca98edc41ec070d2","ja":"にゃははっ、面白そう！\nバレないように、気合い入れて変装しなきゃだね！","zh":"喵哈哈，好像很有趣！\n为了不被发现，得打起精神好好乔装一番才行呢！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1672.unity3d","item_key":"commands[14].text","source_sha256":"84498c8dcc80822761ec1fb039094f3d569dfb25720dcd94da99dc68706cd6d7","ja":"演技力も試されそうだね……うん、わかった。\nやるからには本気で！　しっかり準備しよう！","zh":"演技力似乎也会受到考验呢……嗯，我知道了。\n既然要做就要全力以赴！好好做准备吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1672.unity3d","item_key":"commands[23].text","source_sha256":"8275a0fa6f6540dcdf9e0d96d1d901815a22101dff4fb59161fbebe4d630854a","ja":"見て見てっ！　大花柄ワンピ！　木を隠すなら森の中、\n茜ちゃんを隠すならカワイイ服の中、だよね！","zh":"快看快看！大花朵图案连衣裙！俗话说想藏起树木就要藏在森林里，\n想藏起小茜就要藏在可爱的衣服里，对吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1672.unity3d","item_key":"commands[24].text","source_sha256":"75f1edd69ce0b71069cb8796aff057fa44be02be3c3f0be0ff26cf2a4af23657","ja":"確かに、最初は服のほうに目がいきそうだけど……\nさすがに目立って、ばれちゃうかもしれないよ。","zh":"确实，虽然一开始可能会先把目光放在衣服上……\n但未免也太显眼了，可能会露馅哦。","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1672.unity3d","item_key":"commands[26].text","source_sha256":"15350422937b52868ca79d00c84b93da592dbcde4f9325f3564d12d2131406d1","ja":"いいの見つけたよ！　鼻眼鏡！\nこれで笑いも変装も完ペキだよね☆","zh":"找到好东西了！大鼻子眼镜！\n这样一来搞笑和变装就都完美无缺了对吧☆","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1672.unity3d","item_key":"commands[27].text","source_sha256":"afddb707b969d01dddc6c7a594555d6431f588c60749b38dd0a0a948e2180d11","ja":"うんうん、アイドルがしてるなんて思われない\nアイテムだよね……って、それも目立ちすぎだよ！","zh":"嗯嗯，这确实是不会让人联想到偶像的\n道具呢……不对，这也太引人注目了吧！","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1672.unity3d","item_key":"commands[28].text","source_sha256":"2683302cd02664d9fc552ddf105c95f24e85533533917fdcf23ae1ce27229b10","ja":"やっぱり、基本はサングラスとマスクに帽子。\nあと、洋服も全身黒ずくめのほうが……？","zh":"果然基本配置还是得墨镜、口罩加帽子。\n而且，衣服是不是也穿一身黑比较好……？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
{"asset_version":"1077750","client_version":null,"source_client_version":"9.0.200","bundle":"event_unit_talk_1672.unity3d","item_key":"commands[29].text","source_sha256":"ac6bfdd7bfcbafcf572f2fbb68661cc05a0c613ddce540e080c167b49bedb98b","ja":"ちょっとちょっと、紗代子ちゃん！？\nそこまでいくと、完全に怪しい人になっちゃうよ！？","zh":"等等，小纱代子！？\n做到那个份上，完全就会变成可疑人物了呀！？","status":"accepted","translation_stage":"llm_translated","updated_at":"2026-10-13T16:09:18+00:00"}
